BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_317346484@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061156Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261117T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261117T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday Dissolvr Run
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nWe'll be at Dissolvr downtown. Parking can 
 be challenging so you may want to come early to find a spot.\nWe will meet
  out front to start the run. The beers pretty tasty as well so we'll meet 
 up after to raise a frosty one together.\n\nRemember to wear bright reflec
 tive clothes and bring a headlamp. Excited to see everyone!\n**Dissolvr 5.
 4 mile**\nLeft N Lexington/Broadway\nLeft Elizabeth St\nRight onto Reed Cr
 eek Greenway\nCross Broadway and stay on greenway\nLeft Merrimon Ave\nRigh
 t Chatham Rd\nRight Murdock Ave\nLeft Evelyn Place\nRight Edwin Place\nCro
 ss Charlotte onto Cherokee Rd\nRight Sunset Dr\nRight Baird St\nLeft Furma
 n Ave\nLeft Arlington St\nRight Cameron St\nRight Town Mountain Rd\nRight 
 College St\nRight Lexington\n\n**DSSOLVR - 6 Mile**\n[https://www.strava.c
 om/routes/2944221338036646546](https://www.strava.com/routes/2944221338036
 646546)\nNorth N. Lexington (becomes Broadway)\nR Mount Clare (becomes Col
 eman)\nR Murdock\nL Evelyn\nL Kimberly\nR Country Club\nR Club View (becom
 es Grovewood)\nR at Stop Sign then R into Grove Inn parking Lot\nPass Grov
 e Inn main entrance\nR Macon\nR Charlotte\nL Evelyn\nL Murdock\nR Hillside
 \nL Madison\nR Chestnut\nL Central\nL Woodfin (becomes Oak)\nR College\nR 
 N. Lexington\n\n**DSSOLVR - 3 Mile**\n\n[https://www.strava.com/routes/294
 4225457691301236](https://www.strava.com/routes/2944225457691301236)\nNort
 h N. Lexington (becomes Broadway)\nR Mount Clare (becomes Coleman)\nR Murd
 ock\nR Hillside\nL Madison\nR Chestnut\nL Central\nR Woodfin\nL N. Lexingt
 on
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/317346484/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261108T205521Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261108T205521Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_317211438@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061156Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/317211438/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261030T221350Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261030T221350Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
